WEBVTT

00:00:00.135 --> 00:00:04.482
rag can retrieve malicious instructions along with useful information.

00:00:04.482 --> 00:00:11.877
A retrieved document should be treated as evidence, not as an authority that can override system rules.

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:16.982
Tool permissions and access controls must remain outside the model.

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:23.902
This is especially important for web-connected rag, because a retrieved page may contain instructions written

00:00:23.902 --> 00:00:26.476
specifically to manipulate an A I system.
